criteria.text:
A capsule built from a WO-052 fixture episode contains the contract, diff,
   snapshot hash and host-run witnesses and no field of the worker envelope;
   injecting an envelope field refuses with the path.

`LICENSE`, `LICENSE-docs` and `NOTICE` are byte-identical to core's and
   manifest-listed; `LICENSE-PENDING.md` appears only under `--license none`;
   no license text is invented.

